=head2 SDL_GetDisplayForRect

  my $result = SDL_GetDisplayForRect($rect);

C: C<< SDL_DisplayID SDL_GetDisplayForRect(const SDL_Rect * rect) >>

Get the display primarily containing a rect.

This function should only be called on the main thread.

